@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title Failure domains and operational checks
component "Nginx ingress" as Ingress
component "PHP-FPM / Laravel" as App
database PostgreSQL as DB
component "Git executable and storage" as Git
component "Actions worker if candidate requires it" as Worker
artifact "Sanitized logs and acceptance evidence" as Evidence
Ingress --> Evidence : TLS and routing checks
App --> Evidence : /up runtime liveness
DB --> Evidence : connectivity and migrations
Git --> Evidence : permissions and clone/fetch/push
Worker --> Evidence : queue consumption and run completion
note bottom of Evidence : /up alone does not establish readiness\nSingle host remains one shared failure domain
@enduml
